===============================================================================
  WHAT IS COVERED
===============================================================================

  Everything in this repository authored by the licensor: the TypeScript
  source, the procedural Đông Hồ drawing code and the images it produces,
  the portrait parts under public/faces/, the game data (heroes, cards,
  edicts, stories, provinces), the Vietnamese and English text, the design
  documents under docs/, and the verification harnesses under test_scripts/.

  Third-party components keep their own licences and are not covered by
  these terms — see "Third-party components" at the end of this file.

  The historical events, figures and folk tales this game draws on are not
  anyone's property. Nothing here claims rights over the history itself;
  only over this particular telling of it.

